#### [dashboard/layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/frontend/src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx)
- Added a **Settings** link to the navigation sidebar for all roles (`CC_ADMIN`, `HOD`, `Applicant`).

#### [dashboard/settings/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/BHU%20INTERNSHIP%20PROJECT/frontend/src/app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx)
- **Created a new Settings UI** inside the dashboard.
- Includes a dedicated "Change Password" section containing:
  - An input for the `Current Password`.
  - Inputs for `New Password` and `Confirm New Password`.
